      "text": {
        "en": "Clients praise the veterinary team and front desk staff for their attentive attitudes and clear advice during consultations. While two reviewers noted friction regarding appointment terms or handling, the large majority of pet owners praise the clinicians for their polite and helpful demeanour."
      }
