        "en": "Gentle approach to nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents describe gentle handling during vaccination visits, dental cleanings, and physical checkups. Clinicians are praised for putting uneasy pets at ease, although one owner felt staff should exercise greater caution when handling naturally nervous dogs during physical examinations."
      }
    },
    {
